    "sentence_translations": [
      "Selling a Cow for Schooling",
      "",
      "There was a classmate from Inner Mongolia in our class. His skin was dark, and he wasn’t particularly tall either.",
      "",
      "As soon as we started, he said that in order for him to go to college, his family sold a cow.",
      "At that time we were all under the impression that his family had no money. We thought that he was very pitiful, ..",
      ".. and had no money to eat good food. So during the four years of college, we often treated him to meals.",
      "",
      "When we graduated from college, he invited us to his to take a trip to his home.",
      "Only when we got to his home did we realize that his family was actually extremely well-off, ..",
      ".. even wealthier than our families.",
      "Because their family had several hundred cows. The one they sold at the time was only one of their family’s cows.",
      ""
